    "grammarTopic": "To Be - Negative",
    "title": "Negativas com To Be",
    "explanation": "Para formar frases negativas com 'to be', adicione 'not' após o verbo. Formas contraídas são comuns na fala: isn't, aren't, I'm not.",
    "formula": "Subject + am/is/are + not + complement",
    "sortOrder": 2,
    "iconEmoji": "🚫",
    "examples": [
      {
        "sentence": "I am not hungry.",
